Package: stReans
Type: Package
Title: Batch and Streaming K-Means Clustering with a C Backend
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Łukasz", "Lepianka", email = "01159348@pw.edu.pl", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements Lloyd's algorithm with k-means++ initialisation for batch
    data and an incremental online k-means for streaming data. The core
    computations are performed in C via the R native API for performance.
